      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Specialized enclosed hydraulic ramp carriers represent the definitive standard for modern vehicle logistics, offering a controlled environment that shields premium assets from environmental degradation. Unlike open trailers, these units utilize synchronized hydraulic systems to deploy ramps, allowing for precise, low-angle vehicle entry and exit.</p>
